WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.434
Yennenga, laamiiɗo mawɗo. Fedde moƴƴere.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.144
Nder lesdi Gambaga, nder lesdi dagomba, laamiiɗo Nedega ummini.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.930
O ɗon teddina ɓiɗɗo maako. Ɓeydi mawnugo dow maako, ɓurɗum fuu konu'en.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.018
Yennenga woni ardiiɗo hawrotooɓe. Walaa goɗɗo mo nandi bee maako, walaa mo nandi e maako.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.400
Yimɓe konne'en ɓe ngi'i mo, ɓe ndilli.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.120
Ngam maajum o wurtini baaba maako nder jaalorgal.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.476
Baabiraawo, mi yiɗi dewta, e woodi ɓiɓɓe.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.414
On ɗon mari sembe masin ngam haɓugo. Walaa.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.274
O torraaki, haa e ɗon. O yejjitataa.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.360
Sey o jippini haa nokkuure ɓadake laamiiɗo.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:00.854
Luttuɗum ɓanngini, ɓaawo maajum maaki. O jaɓataa ɗum. Ko o wi'i ɗon laaɓti: "Ɗum ɓeydaaki".

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.400
Ammaa laamiiɗo yi'aayi faamu.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:18.152
Nder jemma go'o, Yennenga dartini sooje maako jeɗɗi, nden o wurti Gambaga.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.104
O dilli dow lewru, o yahrataa.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.040
Ɗuum waɗi o yaari haa nokkuure nde o anndaa.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.202
O ɓeydii, o dilli. Sey goɗɗo ɓaditoo to maako.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.900
Moy woni? Ko honɗun waɗi ɗo?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.900
Innde am Yennenga. Mi acci koo ɗume.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.856
To'o jooɗoto, to'o ɗon nder jam.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:31.386
Kanko woni Rialé, mawɗo duɗal gootol. Ɓe ngiɗi, ɓe ngoodi ɓiɗɗo gorko.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.448
O noddiray wi'eteeɗo Ouédraogo.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.552
Ngam maajum ɓiyiiko o noddiri ko'e maako.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:08.050
Too, duuɓi ɗuuɗɗi naati. Yennenga wartii Gambaga bee ɓiɗɗo maako.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.778
Laamiiɗo mawɗo on anndi mo. O yaafani mo, o jaɓii ɓiyum maako.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.416
O hokki Ouédraogo koyɗe e konu.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.328
Ɗon woni fuɗɗam taariika Ouedraogo, ardiiɗo ummaatoore Mossi.
